{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11307190","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11307190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130719001:1":{"text":"현상금 사냥꾼들은 돈을 위해 수단과 방법을 가리지 않는 나쁜 녀석들이야!","source_cn":"赏金猎人是一群为了钱不择手段的混蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB241F707DB68DDF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130719002:1":{"text":"전에 어떤 현상금 사냥꾼이 나와 제이콥을 고용하며 매일 동전 열 개에 숙식까지 제공하겠다며 꼬드겼어.","source_cn":"之前一个赏金猎人说要雇佣我和雅各布做帮工，每天十个铜币...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E02B81521D451F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130719003:1":{"text":"나랑 제이콥은 매일 아침부터 저녁까지 뼈 빠지게 일만 하고...","source_cn":"我和雅各布每天给他喂马搬货，从早忙到晚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9173AF757A08B91B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130719004:1":{"text":"결국 그놈은 온갖 핑계를 대면서 급료는커녕, 우리를 마구간에 재우면서 식사도 제대로 주지 않았어.","source_cn":"结果他一直找各种借口不给我们佣金，让我们住马棚，连肉都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91A3452BD5D2167B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130719005:1":{"text":"급기야 우리를 사막의 발톱에 팔아 치우려고 하는 게 아니겠어?!","source_cn":"到最后，他甚至还想把我们骗去给流沙之爪当劳工！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB378DA1340B6A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1130719006:1":{"text":"다행히 그놈의 정체를 알아채고 제때 도망쳤으니 망정이지…","source_cn":"还好我们及时看清了他的真面目，逃了出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41219BC0B6E0A7CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:流浪汉韦弗":{"text":"위버","source":"流浪汉韦弗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":1}}